#question(title: [Harmonic series])[
  #set text(size: 13pt)

  For each $n > 0$ we define
  $
    r_n = thick thin #[smallest power of $2$ that is greater than or equal to
    $n$] thin
  $

  Consider the series
  $display(S = sum_(n = 1)^oo 1/(r_n))$
  #v(0.2cm)

  #set enum(spacing: .55em + 0.2cm)
  + Compute $display(r_1)$ through
    $display(r_8)$
  + Compute the partial sums
    $display(S_1 comma S_2 comma S_4 comma S_8)$
    for the series $S$.
  + Calculate
    $display(S = sum_(n = 1)^oo 1/(r_n))$.
  + Calculate
    $display(H = sum_(n = 1)^oo 1/n)$.
    #h(1fr) #emph[Hint:] “Compare" $H$ and
    $S$.
]
